1
00:00:00,543 --> 00:00:05,171
RentalPro — Admin and Tenant in Action
Signing in as the administrator, Abdur-Rahmaan Ali

2
00:00:05,321 --> 00:00:09,677
Admin Dashboard
The whole Harare portfolio at a glance: properties, occupancy, rent collected and outstanding

3
00:00:09,827 --> 00:00:14,830
Manage Users
Only the administrator sees this page: every account, its role, and whether it is active

4
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:19,694
Rent Tracker
Paid-up leases in green, balances due in red — Precious Ndlovu owes this month’s $1,400

5
00:00:19,844 --> 00:00:24,820
Recording a Payment
Precious Ndlovu paid her $1,400 by cheque at the office — the admin records it

6
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:28,312
Payment Saved
A receipt number is issued and the payment is written to the audit log

7
00:00:28,462 --> 00:00:31,819
Precious Is Paid Up
Her balance is cleared — Nyasha Mapfumo will pay her $600 online herself

8
00:00:31,969 --> 00:00:35,958
Switching to the Tenant
Signing out, then signing in as tenant Nyasha Mapfumo

9
00:00:36,108 --> 00:00:40,463
Tenant Dashboard
Nyasha sees her unit (Eastlea Garden Flats, Unit 3), her $600 balance and her requests

10
00:00:40,613 --> 00:00:45,322
Paying Rent Online
Pay Rent shows the amount due; Pay Now goes to checkout (simulated here, so no real card is charged)

11
00:00:45,472 --> 00:00:49,829
Payment Successful
The balance drops to $0.00 and Nyasha and the owner are both sent a confirmation email

12
00:00:49,979 --> 00:00:54,468
Payment History
Every payment with its date, method and receipt number

13
00:00:54,618 --> 00:01:03,301
Reporting a Problem
Nyasha submits a maintenance request: the bedroom light keeps flickering

14
00:01:03,451 --> 00:01:08,582
Request Submitted
She gets a ticket number, and the request shows on her dashboard as Submitted

15
00:01:08,732 --> 00:01:13,405
Back to the Administrator
The admin signs in again to deal with the new request

16
00:01:13,555 --> 00:01:18,038
New Request in the Queue
Nyasha’s high-severity electrical request is at the top of the maintenance list

17
00:01:18,188 --> 00:01:23,186
Assigning the Job
The admin assigns it to maintenance staff member Farai Ncube with a target date

18
00:01:23,336 --> 00:01:28,191
Request Assigned
Status is now Assigned — Farai and Nyasha are both notified by email

19
00:01:28,341 --> 00:01:38,592
The Tenant Sees the Update
Signed in again, Nyasha’s dashboard shows her request is Assigned and her rent is paid

